{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You stand at the edge of time, trying to save the last crumbs of humanity, fighting dark creatures that are puppeteered by an even darker force. You, the Paragon of Time, are an ancient hero that has now awaken to complete your mission: Vanquish the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/game.png?t=1744291929\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Paragon Of Time</i></strong> is a rogue-lite adventure game where you collect powerful upgrades and forge new weapons to strengthen your character. <br><br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/forge.png?t=1744291929\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you fight your way through, you\u2019ll destroy enemies to claim mighty artefacts, and use them to enhance your abilities and weapons. This way, you can make unique builds that suit your playstyle, making most playthroughs unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/level_up.png?t=1744291929\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each played round, you will be able to permanently improve your character by purchasing upgrades using the souls of your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/shop.png?t=1744291929\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your ultimate goal is to overcome the final challenge\u2014the all-consuming malice that enshrouds the earth\u2014and bring an end to its corruption.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600970?t=1744291929","background_raw":"http